      "text": [
        "4275 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"مَنْ حَلَفَ عَلَى يَمِينٍ فَرَأَى مَا هُوَ خَيْرٌ مِنْهَا فَلْيَأْتِ اَلَّذِي هُوَ خَيْرٌ مِنْهَا وَ لَهُ زِيَادَةُ حَسَنَةٍ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4275 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Whoever swears an oath and then sees something better than it, let him do that which is better, and he will have an additional good deed.\""
        ]
      }
